                                                "sense_id": "0d4da5f0-b255-3efb-b70f-0202a9aa2db9",
                                                "text": "Convicted in Federal District Court in Brooklyn of insurance fraud, a 35-year-old legal secretary could have received up to 50 years in prison and a $56,000 fine. The judge sentenced her instead to house arrest for two years."
                                            }
